config SMB358_STATUS
	tristate "Summit SMB358 charger status monitor (read-only)"
	depends on I2C && POWER_SUPPLY
	help
	  Read-only status monitor for the Summit SMB358 charger found on
	  boards (e.g. Lenovo PHAB Plus) where it does all charging and the
	  PMIC charger block is unused. Exposes ONLINE/STATUS from the SMB358
	  status registers; never writes charger configuration.
